Build the default file-only client without warnings

io_error serves only the socket wire, so it is compiled with ipc-compat.
The indicator and catalog units the file wire does not carry yet are
expected dead code without ipc-compat (the expectation fails once they are
used), and commit_encoded matches both wires explicitly. Clippy is clean
with and without the feature.
